     Recent developments in Libxc - A comprehensive library of functionals for density functional theory
     Software X 2018 7 , 
     doi.org/10.1016/j.softx.2017.11.002
  5. Caldeweyher, E.; Ehlert, S.; Hansen, A.; Neugebauer, H.; Spicher, S.; Bannwarth, C.; Grimme, S.
     A generally applicable atomic-charge dependent London dispersion correction
     J. Chem. Phys. 2019 150 , 154122
     doi.org/10.1063/1.5090222
  6. Helmich-Paris, B.; de Souza, B.; Neese, F.; Izsák, R.
     An improved chain of spheres for exchange algorithm
     J. Chem. Phys. 2021 155(10), 104109
     doi.org/10.1063/5.0058766
